{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "他们把我当成是你身边的人  (They Treat Me Like One of Your People)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "wang_er": "王尔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Luo Lin goes on television to smear Chun Yuqiao as a ruthless manipulator, Xingzi promises Yuqiao that she and Kaiwen will stand beside him through anything—while Bu Xiaogu quietly visits Wang Er undercover, pretending she is fed up with Xingtian. Listen to Xingzi, Xiaogu, and Wang Er in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，我和凯文跟着你一路走到今天，咱们什么样的考验没经历过呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算他们是蓄谋已久的，我们照样陪着你闯过来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王尔老师，他们说这次是您出手做局，是真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你觉得呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得他们以前那么对您，就算您做出这种事情来也不是没有道理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你真这么想的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对啊，他们之前一直排挤您，我早就看不顺眼了，觉得特别不公平。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这淳于乔眼里容不下别人，我早跟你说过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我最近也发现，以前是我看错他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷啊，我知道你是为了这个大师兄才来的星天，可他现在这样对你，你心里一定不好受吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次他们把我当成是您身边的人，我感觉星天是待不下去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王老师，我想去上个洗手间。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，我和凯文跟着你一路走到今天，咱们什么样的考验没经历过呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, Kaiwen and I have walked beside you all the way to today — what trial haven't we weathered together?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算他们是蓄谋已久的，我们照样陪着你闯过来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if they plotted this trap long ago, we will charge right through it at your side!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王尔老师，他们说这次是您出手做局，是真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wang Er, people at the office say you engineered this whole setup — is that true?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你觉得呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you think?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得他们以前那么对您，就算您做出这种事情来也不是没有道理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Given how badly they treated you before, even if you did pull this off, I wouldn't blame you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你真这么想的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you really feel that way?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对啊，他们之前一直排挤您，我早就看不顺眼了，觉得特别不公平。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes! Seeing them push you out back then never sat right with me — it felt completely unfair.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这淳于乔眼里容不下别人，我早跟你说过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao has no room in his eyes for anyone else — I warned you about him from the start.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我最近也发现，以前是我看错他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lately I've realized it myself — I completely misjudged him before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷啊，我知道你是为了这个大师兄才来的星天，可他现在这样对你，你心里一定不好受吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, I know you joined Xingtian for your senior alumnus, and seeing him date a superstar must sting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次他们把我当成是您身边的人，我感觉星天是待不下去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now everyone treats me like one of your insiders — I feel I can't stay at Xingtian much longer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王老师，我想去上个洗手间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wang, may I use your washroom for a moment?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，我和凯文跟着你一路走到今天，咱们什么样的考验没经历过呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算他们是蓄谋已久的，我们照样陪着你闯过来！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王尔老师，他们说这次是您出手做局，是真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你觉得呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得他们以前那么对您，就算您做出这种事情来也不是没有道理。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你真这么想的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对啊，他们之前一直排挤您，我早就看不顺眼了，觉得特别不公平。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这淳于乔眼里容不下别人，我早跟你说过了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我最近也发现，以前是我看错他了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷啊，我知道你是为了这个大师兄才来的星天，可他现在这样对你，你心里一定不好受吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次他们把我当成是您身边的人，我感觉星天是待不下去了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王老师，我想去上个洗手间。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Convincing the cunning Wang Er that she resents Chun Yuqiao's romance and workplace treatment, Xiaogu excuses herself to the washroom to prepare her hidden recording for Episode 13! See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
